.DS_Store
node_modules/
dist/

# Graphify
graphify-out/

# Clone-local configuration. Layers over the committed vibeops.config.ts; holds what is true of one
# working tree on one machine, including the applied-version map promulgation writes. The committed
# counterpart declaring which keys exist is vibeops.config.local.example.ts.
vibeops.config.local.ts
vibeops.config.local.mjs
vibeops.config.local.js

# The machine's own layer, and the only config file this tooling writes rather than reads: `harness sync`
# records here what it promulgated into this clone. Ignored for the same reason as the three above and
# one more — it is written by a command rather than by a person, so tracking it would turn every
# promulgation into a diff in a file the repository owns.
vibeops.config.local.json

# Gambiarra: the sibling path every repo under this workspace resolves the runner through.
# The runner moved to cli/packages/module-check/sh/; seven repos still look for vibe-ops/scripts/.
# Local symlink, never committed — the real fix is those repos moving to the CLI.
/scripts
/sh
